command: git show <phase commit>:records/logs/m3p7-p4/run.log | grep -o -E '^command: sha256sum <scripts>/readme_check[.]py: [0-9a-f]{64}$' -> lines 1; the hash: f87526a34e00242c582db02da8eaee92b6c6dd944253e0679fa82d0e67f25dbc
  M3 part 7 P4's run log prints the README check program's hash once: yes
  the README check program here is that program, byte for byte by its sha256 (change GC): yes
